- 0.2: ship /usr/share/plymouth/plymouthd.defaults (Theme=vilna,
  ShowDelay=0, DeviceTimeout=8). Without it plymouthd aborted with
  "Assertion 'seconds > 0.0' failed" in the initrd and after switching
  root, so no splash showed and boot waited ~60 s (VM test, Build11.2).

